{
  "description": "Von Thünen bid-rent engine — each crop draws a bid-rent line (rent versus distance to market) on a math-canvas; the transport-cost and market-price dials shift every line's slope and intercept, and the concentric ring boundaries (line intersections) redraw live. Standalone by default; behind a lab router set matchMode and it renders only when MODE_SELECTED matches.",
