              "description": "Ordered innermost-to-outermost roster of crops; each declares yield per hectare, base market price, fixed production cost, and per-km transport rate. Bid-rent line for a crop: rent(d) = basePrice x priceDial x yield - fixedCost - transportRate x costDial x d.",
